"Romans 10:14–15":[44,[[10,14,"How then can they call on the One in whom they have not believed? And how can they believe in the One of whom they have not heard? And how can they hear without someone to preach?"],[10,15,"And how can they preach unless they are sent? As it is written: “How beautiful are the feet of those who bring good news!”"]]],
"Romans 10:15":[44,[[10,15,"And how can they preach unless they are sent? As it is written: “How beautiful are the feet of those who bring good news!”"]]],
