"Titus 1:13":[55,[[1,13,"This testimony is true. Therefore rebuke them sternly, so that they will be sound in the faith"]]],
"Titus 2:1":[55,[[2,1,"But as for you, speak the things that are consistent with sound doctrine."]]],
"Titus 2:1–5":[55,[[2,1,"But as for you, speak the things that are consistent with sound doctrine."],[2,2,"Older men are to be temperate, dignified, self-controlled, and sound in faith, love, and perseverance."],[2,3,"Older women, likewise, are to be reverent in their behavior, not slanderers or addicted to much wine, but teachers of good."],[2,4,"In this way they can train the young women to love their husbands and children,"],[2,5,"to be self-controlled, pure, managers of their households, kind, and submissive to their own husbands, so that the word of God will not be discredited."]]],
"Titus 2:2–4":[55,[[2,2,"Older men are to be temperate, dignified, self-controlled, and sound in faith, love, and perseverance."],[2,3,"Older women, likewise, are to be reverent in their behavior, not slanderers or addicted to much wine, but teachers of good."],[2,4,"In this way they can train the young women to love their husbands and children,"]]],
