"2 John 4–5":[62,[[1,4,"I was overjoyed to find some of your children walking in the truth, just as the Father has commanded us."],[1,5,"And now I urge you, dear lady—not as a new commandment to you, but one we have had from the beginning—that we love one another."]]],
