"Revelation 2:4–5":[65,[[2,4,"But I have this against you: You have abandoned your first love."],[2,5,"Therefore, keep in mind how far you have fallen. Repent and perform the deeds you did at first. But if you do not repent, I will come to you and remove your lampstand from its place."]]],
